// microbench nhop2_hetero: the distinct tags on the messages a person created (TM1's
// heterogeneous chain: person <-hasCreator- message -hasTag-> tag).
// Reads: the hasCreator _to edge index from the anchor, then the hasTag _from edge index of each
// message; returns each distinct tag's _key only.
// Evaluator: queries/nhop.py nhop2_hetero -- read_neighbors(hasCreator, in) + dedup +
// read_neighbors(hasTag, out) + dedup; one row per tag.
// mb2 lineage: MB43-44 (no arango text in mb2).
FOR m IN 1..1 INBOUND CONCAT("Person/", @personId) hasCreator
    FOR t IN 1..1 OUTBOUND m hasTag
        RETURN DISTINCT t._key
